    },
    "Allow it in System Settings to dictate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisez-le dans les Réglages Système pour dicter."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在系统设置中允许，然后即可听写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allowed": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also bias the model toward these terms while listening, not just fix them afterwards. Helps rare, distinctive words, but can over-correct short, common ones. Applies to every entry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oriente aussi le modèle vers ces termes pendant l'écoute, au lieu de seulement les corriger ensuite. Aide pour les mots rares et distinctifs, mais peut surcorriger les mots courts et courants. S'applique à toutes les entrées."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收音时就让模型向这些词倾斜，而不只是事后修正。对生僻、有辨识度的词有帮助，但可能过度纠正简短常用的词。对所有词条生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also help recognition of this word": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aussi aider la reconnaissance du mot"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时帮助识别这个词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also keep it on the clipboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le garder aussi dans le presse-papiers"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同时保留在剪贴板中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also plays when a recording is locked hands-free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Joue aussi quand un enregistrement est verrouillé en mains libres."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音锁定（解放双手）时也会播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also switchable from the menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aussi modifiable depuis la barre de menus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也可以从菜单栏切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
