        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称（例如 Home LiteLLM）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Names and terms you say often. OpenSuperWhisper recognises them better and writes them the way you want.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les noms et termes que vous dites souvent. OpenSuperWhisper les reconnaît mieux et les écrit comme vous le voulez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你常说的人名和术语。OpenSuperWhisper 能更好地识别它们，并按你想要的方式书写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs a permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autorisation requise"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs the Accessibility permission to see Space in every app. Space is only intercepted while a recording runs; no other keystroke is captured.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nécessite l'autorisation Accessibilité pour voir Espace dans toutes les apps. Espace n'est intercepté que pendant un enregistrement ; aucune autre frappe n'est capturée."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要辅助功能权限，才能在各应用中检测空格键。空格键只在录音期间被拦截，不会捕获任何其他按键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New entry": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouvelle entrée"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建词条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New word": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveau mot"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新词"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New words only help recognition when “Help recognition of these words” is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les nouveaux mots n'aident la reconnaissance que si « Aider la reconnaissance de ces mots » est activé."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有开启“帮助识别这些词”，新词才会帮助识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No app chosen": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune app choisie"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未选择应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No app has its own settings yet. Add one, or bind a model from the menu-bar “Model” submenu while an app is in front.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune app n'a encore ses propres réglages. Ajoutez-en une, ou associez un modèle depuis le sous-menu « Modèle » de la barre de menus quand une app est au premier plan."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有应用拥有专属设置。可以手动添加，或在目标应用位于前台时，从菜单栏的“模型”子菜单中绑定模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No corrections yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune correction pour l'instant."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有修正记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No dictations here": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune dictée ici"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里没有听写记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No dictations yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune dictée pour l'instant"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有听写记录"
          }
        }
