    "Suppress blank output": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprimer les sorties vides"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "抑制空白输出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Synthetic keystrokes. Leaves the clipboard alone. Raise the pace if this app falls behind.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frappes simulées. Laisse le presse-papiers intact. Augmentez le rythme si cette app prend du retard."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模拟按键输入，不占用剪贴板。若目标应用跟不上，可调大节奏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Valeur par défaut du système"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System default": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Par défaut du système"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统默认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System follows macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système suit macOS."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统会跟随 macOS。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teach it your punctuation": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apprenez-lui votre ponctuation"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "教它你的标点习惯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teach punctuation": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apprendre la ponctuation"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "标点符号教学"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell us what went wrong or what you'd like. It goes straight to the team.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dites-nous ce qui n'a pas marché ou ce que vous aimeriez. Ça arrive directement à l'équipe."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告诉我们哪里出了问题，或你想要什么。反馈会直达团队。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temperature": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Température"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "温度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tester"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Connection": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tester la connexion"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text & AI": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Texte & IA"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字与 AI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text around the cursor": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Texte autour du curseur"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "光标周围的文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks! It reached us. 🍌": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merci ! C'est bien arrivé. 🍌"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "谢谢！我们已收到。🍌"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bigger model follows instructions far more reliably; the smaller one is quicker and lighter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le grand modèle suit les instructions bien plus fidèlement ; le petit est plus rapide et plus léger."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更大的模型遵循指令更可靠；更小的模型更快速、更轻量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dictionary is off. Your entries are kept but nothing is replaced or recognised better.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dictionnaire est désactivé. Vos entrées sont conservées, mais rien n'est remplacé ni mieux reconnu."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "词典已关闭。你的词条会被保留，但不会再替换词语或提升识别效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The engine below is used by the per-app formatting rules in Style.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le moteur ci-dessous sert aux règles de mise en forme par app de Style."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下方引擎供“样式”里的按应用格式规则使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The inserted text is translated into English.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le texte inséré est traduit en anglais."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插入的文字会被翻译成英语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language of menus and settings. Relaunch to apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La langue des menus et des réglages. Relancez pour appliquer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单和设置使用的语言。重新启动后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last words recognised": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les derniers mots reconnus"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后识别出的词语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone isn't allowed yet, so nothing will be heard. Go back a step to allow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le micro n'est pas encore autorisé, donc rien ne sera entendu. Revenez une étape en arrière pour l'autoriser."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未允许使用麦克风，因此听不到任何声音。请返回上一步进行授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model chosen for this site is forgotten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle choisi pour ce site est oublié."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已取消为此网站选择的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model didn't load": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle ne s'est pas chargé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型未能加载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model didn't return a usable translation, so your text was kept. Small models struggle with this; Ollama or a remote model handles it reliably.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle n'a pas renvoyé de traduction exploitable ; votre texte a été conservé. Les petits modèles peinent sur cette tâche ; Ollama ou un modèle distant s'en sort de façon fiable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模型没有返回可用的翻译，因此保留了你的原文。小模型难以胜任；Ollama 或远程模型则能可靠完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model is built into macOS: downloaded per language by the system, shared across apps and updated with the OS. Nothing is stored in the app. Using a language here also sets the spoken language. macOS keeps up to 5 languages per app and rotates them beyond that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle est intégré à macOS : téléchargé par langue par le système, partagé entre les apps et mis à jour avec l'OS. Rien n'est stocké dans l'app. Utiliser une langue ici règle aussi la langue parlée. macOS conserve jusqu'à 5 langues par app et les fait tourner au-delà."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该模型内置于 macOS：由系统按语言下载，在应用间共享，并随系统更新。应用内不存储任何内容。在此选择语言也会同时设定口语语言。macOS 为每个应用最多保留 5 种语言，超出的会自动轮换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The model that turns your voice into text. Everything runs on this Mac unless you pick a server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle qui transforme votre voix en texte. Tout tourne sur ce Mac, sauf si vous choisissez un serveur."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将你的语音变成文字的模型。除非你选择服务器，否则一切都在这台 Mac 上运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The punctuation came back already written, so there was nothing standing in for it. That usually means the model is doing it for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La ponctuation est revenue déjà écrite, il n'y avait donc rien à sa place. Cela signifie généralement que le modèle la gère pour vous."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写结果已自带标点，无需再补。这通常说明模型在自动帮你加标点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recommendation follows your language.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La recommandation suit votre langue."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐会跟随你的语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The right Option key": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La touche Option de droite"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右侧 Option 键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The right model to start with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bon modèle pour commencer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适合作为起点的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server's models are listed here after a successful Test Connection — most providers (e.g. Groq) need the API key set first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les modèles du serveur s'affichent ici après un test de connexion réussi ; la plupart des fournisseurs (Groq par ex.) demandent d'abord la clé API."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试连接成功后，此处会列出服务器模型 — 大多数提供商（例如 Groq）需先设置 API 密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The snippet's name before it is inserted": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le nom du snippet avant son insertion"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插入前显示片段名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The words land wherever the cursor is: here, or in any other app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mots arrivent là où se trouve le curseur : ici, ou dans n'importe quelle autre app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文字会插入光标所在之处：这里，或任何其他应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then the agent goes back to its terminal, where you can still answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Puis l'agent retourne à son terminal, où vous pouvez toujours répondre."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "随后 Agent 会回到它的终端，你仍可在那里回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These record only while held and stop when released, whatever Hold to record says. Pair a shortcut above with a held key here, like Right ⌥ Option.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ceux-ci n'enregistrent que tant qu'ils sont maintenus et s'arrêtent au relâchement, quel que soit le réglage Maintenir pour enregistrer. Associez un raccourci ci-dessus à une touche maintenue ici, comme ⌥ Option droite."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无论“按住录音”如何设置，这些按键都只在按住时录音、松开即停止。可将上方的快捷键与此处按住的按键配对，例如右侧 ⌥ Option。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This pattern is not a valid regular expression: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce motif n'est pas une expression régulière valide : %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该模式不是有效的正则表达式：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tiếng Việt": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiếng Việt"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tiếng Việt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To dictate": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour dicter"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写触发键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To hear you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour vous entendre."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为了听到你说话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To notice right ⌥ while another app is in front. macOS asks once, when the app starts listening for the key. Only modifier keys are watched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour remarquer ⌥ droite quand une autre app est au premier plan. macOS le demande une fois, quand l'app commence à écouter la touche. Seules les touches de modification sont surveillées."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于在其他应用位于前台时感知右侧 ⌥ 键。应用开始监听该键时，macOS 会询问一次。仅监听修饰键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To type your words into other apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour taper vos mots dans les autres apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把你说的话键入其他应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aujourd'hui"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Together these two are the entire system prompt, nothing is added around them. The closing half stays the model's last word, after any app rule. A small model tends to answer in the language the prompt is written in, so write it in the language you dictate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À elles deux, elles constituent l'intégralité de l'invite système, rien n'est ajouté autour. La partie finale reste le dernier mot adressé au modèle, après toute règle d'app. Un petit modèle a tendance à répondre dans la langue de l'invite, alors rédigez-la dans la langue que vous dictez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这两段合起来就是完整的系统提示词，前后不会再添加任何内容。收尾部分始终是模型的最后一句话，排在所有应用规则之后。小模型倾向于用提示词本身的语言作答，因此请用你听写时使用的语言来写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top right": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En haut à droite"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右上角"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribe": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcrire"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transcribe audio files": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
