    "Typing pace": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rythme de frappe"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打字速度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Understands your language well. Runs on this Mac, no account needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comprend bien votre langue. Tourne sur ce Mac, sans compte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "能很好地理解你的语言。在这台 Mac 上运行，无需账户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unencrypted http:// unless you type https://.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "http:// non chiffré, sauf si vous tapez https://."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "除非输入 https://，否则使用未加密的 http://。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unloads the Qwen model (about 1 GB, or 4 GB for the 7B model) after 5 minutes without a dictation and reloads it when you dictate. Saves memory, but the first cleanup after a break takes a few seconds longer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Décharge le modèle Qwen (environ 1 Go, ou 4 Go pour le modèle 7B) après 5 minutes sans dictée et le recharge quand vous dictez. Économise de la mémoire, mais le premier nettoyage après une pause prend quelques secondes de plus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 分钟没有听写后卸载 Qwen 模型（约 1 GB，7B 模型约 4 GB），再次听写时重新加载。节省内存，但空闲一段时间后的第一次清理会多花几秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unloads the Whisper model (about 1 GB) between dictations and reloads it when you dictate. Saves memory, adds a little delay at the start.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Décharge le modèle Whisper (environ 1 Go) entre les dictées et le recharge quand vous dictez. Économise de la mémoire, ajoute un léger délai au démarrage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在两次听写之间卸载 Whisper 模型（约 1 GB），下次听写时再重新加载。可节省内存，但开始时会稍有延迟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates, release notes, and where to tell us what works and what doesn't.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mises à jour, notes de version, et où nous dire ce qui marche et ce qui ne marche pas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更新、发行说明，以及向我们反馈哪些好用、哪些不好用的地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
