    "We can't confirm this server's model supports translation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de confirmer que le modèle de ce serveur gère la traduction."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们无法确认此服务器的模型是否支持翻译。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We read every message. If you left an email, the answer will come there.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous lisons chaque message. Si vous avez laissé un e-mail, la réponse arrivera là."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每条消息我们都会读。如果你留了邮箱，回复会发到那里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What OpenSuperWhisper keeps on your Mac, and for how long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qu'OpenSuperWhisper conserve sur votre Mac, et pendant combien de temps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenSuperWhisper 会在你的 Mac 上保留哪些内容，以及保留多久。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What happened, and what did you expect?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Que s'est-il passé, et qu'attendiez-vous ?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发生了什么，你预期的是什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What happens to the text between your voice and the app: cleanup, formatting, insertion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce qui arrive au texte entre votre voix et l'app : nettoyage, mise en forme, insertion."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文本从你的声音到应用之间会经历什么：清理、格式化、插入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What would make OpenSuperWhisper better for you?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qu'est-ce qui rendrait OpenSuperWhisper meilleur pour vous ?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "怎样才能让 OpenSuperWhisper 更好用？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's new": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveautés"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it matches": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand il correspond"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the front app changes. Bind a model to an app below, or from the menu-bar “Model” submenu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand l'app au premier plan change. Associez un modèle à une app ci-dessous, ou depuis le sous-menu « Modèle » de la barre de menus."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在前台应用切换时生效。可在下方为应用绑定模型，也可通过菜单栏的“模型”子菜单操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the model writes": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand le modèle écrit"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当模型写入时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
