      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lors de la traduction"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where you drop it": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Là où vous la déposez"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖放的位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which regional model transcribes the selected language. Spelling and numbers follow it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle régional qui transcrit la langue choisie. L'orthographe et les nombres en dépendent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "决定所选语言由哪个区域模型转写。拼写和数字格式会随之变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While dictating": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant la dictée"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While recording, Space (or a double tap of the shortcut) keeps it going so you can let go. Space again stops it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pendant l'enregistrement, Espace (ou un double appui sur le raccourci) le maintient pour que vous puissiez lâcher. Espace à nouveau l'arrête."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "录音时，按空格（或连按两次快捷键）可让录音继续，让你松开按键。再按一次空格停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
