            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之后可以在“设置”中更改它，或添加更多快捷键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can do this later. Until then, the main window shows what is missing in its status card.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous pouvez le faire plus tard. D'ici là, la fenêtre principale indique ce qui manque dans sa carte d'état."
