    "The same setting as in System Settings → Sound.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le même réglage que dans Réglages Système → Son."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与系统设置 → 声音中的设置相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This microphone's volume can't be changed from the app. Check it in Sound settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le volume de ce micro ne se règle pas depuis l'app. Vérifiez-le dans les réglages Son."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此麦克风的音量无法在应用内更改。请在“声音”设置中查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Already on this Mac for your language. Nothing to download.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Déjà sur ce Mac pour votre langue. Rien à télécharger."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的语言所需的模型已在这台 Mac 上，无需下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built into macOS, or one download away. Either way, dictation runs on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intégré à macOS, ou à un téléchargement près. Dans les deux cas, la dictée tourne sur ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内置在 macOS 里，或只需一次下载。无论哪种，听写都在这台 Mac 上运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any key, combination or mouse button.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une touche, une combinaison ou un bouton de souris."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任意按键、组合键或鼠标按键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Best accuracy, 1.6 GB": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meilleure précision, 1,6 Go"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最佳准确度，1.6 GB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's own model: fast, private, no account needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle d'Apple : rapide, privé, sans compte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 自家的模型：快速、私密、无需账户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click the field on the card, then press the key or combination you want. A spare mouse button works too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cliquez sur le champ de la carte, puis appuyez sur la touche ou la combinaison voulue. Un bouton de souris libre marche aussi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点按卡片上的输入框，再按下想要的按键或组合键。闲置的鼠标按键也可以。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compact and quick. Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean, Cantonese": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compact et rapide. Chinois, anglais, japonais, coréen, cantonais"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "紧凑又快速。支持中文、英文、日文、韩文、粤语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fastest processing and most accurate, 614 MB": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le plus rapide et le plus précis, 614 Mo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "处理速度最快、准确度最高，614 MB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More accurate than Apple's model. One download, then it runs on this Mac, no account needed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus précis que le modèle d'Apple. Un téléchargement, puis il tourne sur ce Mac, sans compte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "比 Apple 的模型更准确。下载一次，之后就在这台 Mac 上运行，无需账户。"
          }
        }
