            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 中打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "terminal": {
      "comment": "Agent panel shortcut hint: what ⌘O does (brings back the terminal the agent runs in).",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "terminal"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not pasted — press %@ to paste it": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas collé — appuyez sur %@ pour le coller"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未粘贴——按 %@ 粘贴"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows “Copied, press ⌘V” when no text field has the focus, and says so when a paste doesn’t land.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affiche « Copié, appuyez sur ⌘V » quand aucun champ de texte n'est actif, et prévient quand un collage n'aboutit pas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当没有文本框获得焦点时，显示“已复制，请按 ⌘V”；粘贴未生效时也会这样提示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, what you had copied before is put back after the paste. Only a paste that doesn’t land, with the warning on and no shortcut to paste it again, leaves the dictation there for ⌘V.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé, ce que vous aviez copié avant est remis en place après le collage. Seul un collage qui n'aboutit pas, avec l'avertissement activé et sans raccourci pour le recoller, y laisse la dictée pour ⌘V."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时，粘贴后会把你之前复制的内容放回剪贴板。只有当粘贴没有送达、警告已开启且没有设置再次粘贴的快捷键时，听写内容才会留在剪贴板中供 ⌘V 使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The dictation stays on the clipboard at least this long after the paste, and until the app has read it. Raise it if an app sometimes pastes your old item instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La dictée reste dans le presse-papiers au moins ce temps-là après le collage, et jusqu'à ce que l'app l'ait lue. Augmentez ce délai si une app colle parfois votre ancien élément à la place."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粘贴后，听写内容至少会在剪贴板中保留这段时间，并保留到目标应用读取为止。如果某些应用偶尔粘贴出你的旧内容，请调大该值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back to the field you started in": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revenir au champ de départ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回到原来的输入框"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you click elsewhere while the dictation is transcribed, the text still goes where you were when you started. Turn it off to have it land wherever you are by then.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si vous cliquez ailleurs pendant la transcription, le texte va quand même là où vous étiez au début. Désactivez pour qu’il arrive là où vous êtes à ce moment-là."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转写期间如果你点击了别处，文字仍会插入你开始听写时的位置。关闭后，文字会插入你当时所在的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Match the text around the cursor": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accorder au texte autour du curseur"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配光标周围的文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads the field just before inserting: no capital or final period in the middle of a sentence, and a space where your words meet the ones already there. Fields that can’t be read get the text unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lit le champ juste avant l’insertion : ni majuscule ni point final au milieu d’une phrase, et une espace là où vos mots rejoignent ceux déjà écrits. Les champs illisibles reçoivent le texte tel quel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插入前会先读取文本框：不会在句子中间出现大写或句号，并在你的文字与已有文字相接处加空格。无法读取的文本框将按原样插入文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: the field is not read before inserting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé : le champ n'est pas lu avant l'insertion."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭时，插入前不会读取输入框内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: the model is given nothing from the screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé : le modèle ne reçoit rien de l'écran."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭：不会向模型提供屏幕上的任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: the field is read just before inserting, to fit the case, final period and spaces. It stays in memory for that one insertion and is never saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé : le champ est lu juste avant l'insertion, pour accorder majuscule, point final et espaces. Il reste en mémoire le temps de cette insertion et n'est jamais enregistré."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，插入前会读取输入框内容，以适配大小写、句末句号和空格。内容仅在本次插入期间保留在内存中，绝不会保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lists as bullets": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Listes à puces"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "转为项目符号列表"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A pasted list becomes real bullets or numbers in apps that take formatted text, like Notes, Mail, Slack, Notion, Word and browsers. Everywhere else, terminals and code editors included, it stays as “- ” lines. With AI cleanup on, a spoken enumeration is written as a list for those apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une liste collée devient de vraies puces ou de vrais numéros dans les apps qui acceptent le texte mis en forme, comme Notes, Mail, Slack, Notion, Word et les navigateurs. Partout ailleurs, terminaux et éditeurs de code compris, elle reste en lignes « - ». Avec le nettoyage IA, une énumération dictée est écrite en liste pour ces apps."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在支持格式化文本的应用（如备忘录、邮件、Slack、Notion、Word 和浏览器）中，粘贴的列表会变成真正的项目符号或编号。在其他所有地方（包括终端和代码编辑器），则保持为“- ”行。开启 AI 清理后，口述的列举内容会在这些应用中写成列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long prompts in pieces": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Longues invites en morceaux"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "长提示词分段发送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pastes a long dictation into Claude Code or Codex a few lines at a time, so it shows in full in the prompt instead of as “[Pasted text]”. Only in a terminal whose window title names the agent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Colle une longue dictée dans Claude Code ou Codex quelques lignes à la fois, pour qu’elle s’affiche en entier dans l’invite au lieu de « [Pasted text] ». Seulement dans un terminal dont le titre de fenêtre nomme l’agent."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将较长的听写内容分段（每次几行）粘贴进 Claude Code 或 Codex，让它完整显示在提示框中，而不是变成“[Pasted text]”。仅在窗口标题写有 Agent 名称的终端中生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add the right spelling to your dictionary. Leave “Written as” empty to add it as a new word.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajoutez la bonne orthographe à votre dictionnaire. Laissez « Transcrit » vide pour l'ajouter comme nouveau mot."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把正确的拼写加入你的词典。将“写为”留空，即可作为新词添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to dictionary": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouter au dictionnaire"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加到词典"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added to the dictionary": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouté au dictionnaire"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已添加到词典"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Are you sure you want to delete all recordings? This action cannot be undone. Your reports are kept; delete them from Reports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voulez-vous vraiment supprimer tous les enregistrements ? Cette action est irréversible. Vos signalements sont conservés ; supprimez-les depuis Signalements."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "确定要删除所有录音吗？此操作无法撤销。报告会保留；如需删除，请前往“报告”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio included": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio inclus"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio kept": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio conservé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保留音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before cleanup": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avant nettoyage"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cleanup changed the meaning": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le nettoyage a changé le sens"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理改变了原意"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comment (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commentaire (facultatif)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备注（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy original": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copier l'original"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝原文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy this text, to paste it where the cleaned one went": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copier ce texte, pour le coller à la place du texte nettoyé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拷贝这段文字，粘贴到清理后文本所在的位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't save the report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
