    "A short phrase you would not say by accident. Any case, alone or mid-sentence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une courte phrase que vous ne diriez pas par hasard. Majuscules ou non, seule ou en pleine phrase."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选一句你不会无意间说出口的短语。不区分大小写，单独成句或嵌在句中均可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also bias the model toward your triggers while listening. Helps unusual phrases, but can over-correct short, common ones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oriente aussi le modèle vers vos déclencheurs pendant l'écoute. Aide pour les phrases inhabituelles, mais peut surcorriger les phrases courtes et courantes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收音时还会让模型偏向你的触发词。对不常见的短语有帮助，但可能过度纠正简短常见的词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
