        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你说出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole words, any case, said alone or mid-sentence. Expanded after AI formatting, so your text is never rewritten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mots entiers, majuscules ou non, dits seuls ou en pleine phrase. Insérés après la mise en forme par l'IA, pour que votre texte ne soit jamais réécrit."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整词匹配，不限大小写，单独说或句中均可。在 AI 格式化之后展开，因此绝不会改写你的文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written exactly as you type it here, line breaks included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Écrit exactement comme vous le tapez ici, sauts de ligne compris."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完全按你在此输入的内容书写，包括换行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "my calendar link": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mon lien d'agenda"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我的日历链接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "my email": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mon e-mail"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我的邮箱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "sign off": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ma signature"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "落款"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The trigger is not in this sentence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le déclencheur n'est pas dans cette phrase."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这句话里没有触发词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A trigger needs at least one letter or digit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un déclencheur doit contenir au moins une lettre ou un chiffre."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触发口令至少需要包含一个字母或数字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How does the new OpenSuperWhisper feel?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment trouvez-vous le nouvel OpenSuperWhisper ?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新版 OpenSuperWhisper 用起来感觉如何？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We just rebuilt the whole interface. A few words about what works and what doesn't would help a lot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nous venons de refaire toute l'interface. Quelques mots sur ce qui marche et ce qui ne marche pas nous aideraient beaucoup."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们刚刚重建了整个界面。简单说说哪里好用、哪里不好用，都会帮上大忙。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add “%@” to your dictionary?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouter « %@ » à votre dictionnaire ?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将“%@”添加到词典？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After a dictation, the field it went into is read again for up to a minute. A name or term you fix by hand is offered for the dictionary. It stays on your Mac, and the text read is never saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après une dictée, le champ où elle a été insérée est relu pendant une minute au plus. Un nom ou un terme que vous corrigez à la main vous est proposé pour le dictionnaire. Tout reste sur votre Mac, et le texte lu n'est jamais enregistré."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写后，文字所在的输入框最多会在一分钟内再次被读取。你手动修正过的名字或术语，会被建议加入词典。数据只留在你的 Mac 上，读取的文字绝不会被保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decide later, from Suggested in the Dictionary": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Décider plus tard, depuis Suggéré dans le dictionnaire"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "稍后再决定，可从词典的“推荐”中处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Heard as": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entendu"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "识别为"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No suggestions yet. Fix a word in the text after a dictation, and it will be offered here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucune suggestion pour l'instant. Corrigez un mot dans le texte après une dictée, et il vous sera proposé ici."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂无建议。听写后在文本中修正过某个词，它就会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not this one": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas celui-là"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不是这个"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: the field is not read after a dictation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé : le champ n'est pas relu après une dictée."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭：听写后不读取输入框。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the Dictionary": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir le dictionnaire"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开词典"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggest words from your corrections": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suggérer des mots d'après vos corrections"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "根据你的更正建议词语"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Together these two are the system prompt. Nothing goes between them but any app rule and, while the dictionary is on, its words that are in the dictation, so the model keeps them spelled your way. The closing half stays the model's last word. A small model tends to answer in the language the prompt is written in, so write it in the language you dictate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À elles deux, elles constituent l'invite système. Entre elles ne s'insèrent qu'une éventuelle règle d'app et, tant que le dictionnaire est activé, ceux de ses mots présents dans la dictée, pour que le modèle les garde écrits à votre façon. La partie finale reste le dernier mot adressé au modèle. Un petit modèle a tendance à répondre dans la langue de l'invite, alors rédigez-la dans la langue que vous dictez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这两部分合起来就是系统提示词。两者之间不会插入别的内容，只有应用专属规则除外；词典开启时，其中出现在听写里的词也会插入，让模型按你的拼法书写这些词。结尾部分始终作为提示词的最末内容。小模型倾向于以提示词所用的语言作答，因此请用你听写时所用的语言来撰写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on “Suggest words from your corrections” above, and the words you fix by hand after a dictation will be offered here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activez « Suggérer des mots d'après vos corrections » ci-dessus, et les mots que vous corrigez à la main après une dictée vous seront proposés ici."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启上方的“根据你的更正建议词语”，你每次听写后手动修正过的词就会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words you corrected by hand after a dictation, waiting for your answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mots corrigés à la main après une dictée, en attente de votre réponse"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "听写后你手动修正的字词，等待你的确认"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You wrote it in place of “%@”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous l'avez écrit à la place de « %@ »."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你写下的内容代替了“%@”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On: after a dictation, the field it went into is read again for up to a minute to spot the words you correct. Each word you are offered is kept with what was heard, until you answer or turn this off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activé : après une dictée, le champ où elle a été insérée est relu pendant une minute au plus, pour repérer les mots que vous corrigez. Chaque mot proposé est conservé avec ce qui a été entendu, jusqu'à votre réponse ou jusqu'à ce que vous désactiviez ce réglage."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后：听写完成后，会在最长一分钟内重新读取所输入的文本框，找出你更正的词语。提供给你的每个词语都会连同听到的内容一起保留，直到你作出回应或关闭此功能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Intelligence (recommended)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence (recommandé)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Intelligence（推荐）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Qwen2.5 model running on this Mac. The 1.5B is quick but can change the meaning of a sentence; the 7B is more careful and uses about 4 GB of memory.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un modèle Qwen2.5 qui tourne sur ce Mac. Le 1.5B est rapide mais peut changer le sens d'une phrase ; le 7B est plus soigneux et occupe environ 4 Go de mémoire."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在本机上运行的 Qwen2.5 模型。1.5B 速度快但可能改变句意；7B 更严谨，约占 4 GB 内存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple's on-device model, built into macOS. The most careful one: it fixes grammar without adding or dropping words.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le modèle d'Apple, intégré à macOS. Le plus prudent : il corrige la grammaire sans rien ajouter ni retirer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple 的本机模型，内置于 macOS。最严谨的一个：只修语法，不增删文字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggestions need Accessibility to read the field your dictation went into, and OpenSuperWhisper isn't allowed yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les suggestions ont besoin de l'Accessibilité pour relire le champ où va votre dictée, et OpenSuperWhisper n'y a pas encore accès."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "词典建议需要辅助功能权限来读取听写进入的文本框，目前 OpenSuperWhisper 尚未获得授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Plays when you stop and the text is on its way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Joue quand vous arrêtez et que le texte arrive."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止录音、文字正在生成时播放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Backup and sync": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sauvegarde et synchro"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份与同步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy code and open GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copier le code et ouvrir GitHub"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制代码并打开 GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter this code on github.com, then come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saisissez ce code sur github.com, puis revenez ici."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 github.com 上输入此代码，然后回到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exporter…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fetch": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Récupérer"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "获取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub answered with an error (%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub a répondu par une erreur (%lld)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 返回了错误（%lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub no longer accepts this sign-in. Sign in again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub n'accepte plus cette connexion. Reconnectez-vous."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 已不再接受此登录，请重新登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GitHub sync": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synchro GitHub"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 同步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importer…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导入…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps a copy in a secret gist on your GitHub account, to fetch on another Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Garde une copie dans un gist secret de votre compte GitHub, à récupérer sur un autre Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你的 GitHub 账号中以私密 gist 保存一份副本，可在另一台 Mac 上获取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No settings saved on GitHub yet. Send them from a Mac first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aucun réglage sur GitHub pour l'instant. Envoyez-les d'abord depuis un Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 上还没有保存的设置。请先从一台 Mac 发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replace my settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remplacer mes réglages"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "替换我的设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replace your settings with the copy saved %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remplacer vos réglages par la copie enregistrée %@ ?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要用 %@ 保存的副本替换你的设置吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Replace your settings with this file?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remplacer vos réglages par ce fichier ?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要用此文件替换你的设置吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send saves this Mac's settings to your gist. Fetch replaces them with the saved copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Envoyer enregistre les réglages de ce Mac dans votre gist. Récupérer les remplace par la copie enregistrée."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“发送”会把这台 Mac 的设置保存到你的 gist。“获取”会用已保存的副本替换它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings file": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fichier de réglages"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings imported. Relaunch to apply them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages importés. Relancez pour les appliquer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置已导入。重新启动后生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings saved to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages enregistrés dans %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置已保存到 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings sent to GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages envoyés sur GitHub."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置已发送到 GitHub。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings that are not in the file stay as they are. A relaunch applies the new ones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les réglages absents du fichier restent tels quels. Une relance applique les nouveaux."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件中没有的设置保持不变。重新启动后会应用新的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se connecter avec GitHub"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 GitHub 登录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se déconnecter"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出登录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed in as @%@. Send saves this Mac's settings to your gist. Fetch replaces them with the saved copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connecté en tant que @%@. Envoyer enregistre les réglages de ce Mac dans votre gist. Récupérer les remplace par la copie enregistrée."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已登录为 @%@。“发送”会把这台 Mac 的设置保存到你的 gist。“获取”会用已保存的副本替换它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed in to GitHub.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connecté à GitHub."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已登录 GitHub。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The GitHub code expired. Sign in again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le code GitHub a expiré. Reconnectez-vous."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GitHub 代码已过期，请重新登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings come from a newer version of OpenSuperWhisper. Update the app, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces réglages viennent d'une version plus récente d'OpenSuperWhisper. Mettez l'app à jour, puis réessayez."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些设置来自更新版本的 OpenSuperWhisper。请先更新应用，然后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is not an OpenSuperWhisper settings file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce fichier n'est pas un fichier de réglages OpenSuperWhisper."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件不是 OpenSuperWhisper 设置文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for GitHub…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En attente de GitHub…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在等待 GitHub…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your preferences, dictionary and snippets in one file. API keys stay in this Mac's Keychain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vos préférences, votre dictionnaire et vos snippets dans un seul fichier. Les clés API restent dans le trousseau de ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的偏好设置、词典和片段都在一个文件中。API 密钥保留在这台 Mac 的钥匙串中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last sent %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dernier envoi %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上次发送：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never sent": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jamais envoyé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从未发送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added to the AI cleanup instruction. Describe the tone, the spelling and the words to use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ajouté à l'instruction du nettoyage IA. Décrivez le ton, l'orthographe et les mots à employer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会添加到 AI 清理的指令中。描述语气、拼写方式和要使用的词语。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete style": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprimer le style"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "删除样式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit style": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modifier le style"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑样式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit this style": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modifier ce style"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "编辑此样式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friendly and encouraging, plain British English. Say “volunteers”, never “staff”. Keep every fact as said.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaleureux et encourageant, en français simple. Dire « bénévoles », jamais « personnel ». Garder chaque fait tel quel."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "友好、鼓励的语气，使用简明的中文。说“志愿者”，不要说“员工”。所有事实保持原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to write": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment écrire"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写作方式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Name": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nom"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New style": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nouveau style"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新建样式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See you Thursday for the demo!": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À jeudi pour la démo !"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "周四演示见！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See you on Thursday for the demo.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rendez-vous jeudi pour la démonstration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我们周四演示时见。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shorter instructions work better, especially with small models.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des instructions plus courtes marchent mieux, surtout avec les petits modèles."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指令越短效果越好，尤其是使用小模型时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So see you Thursday for the demo, right?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Donc on se voit jeudi pour la démo, c'est ça ?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "那周四演示见，对吧？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Style: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Style : %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "样式：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Styles shape AI cleanup, which is off. Raw stays as it is either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les styles agissent sur le nettoyage IA, qui est désactivé. Brut ne change rien de toute façon."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "样式作用于 AI 清理，而 AI 清理目前已关闭。“原始”在任何情况下都保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Styles shape AI cleanup. An app can have its own style in its row below. Pro, Personal and your own styles follow their instructions best with Apple Intelligence or a 7B model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les styles agissent sur le nettoyage IA. Une app peut avoir son propre style dans sa ligne ci-dessous. Pro, Perso et vos styles suivent mieux leurs instructions avec Apple Intelligence ou un modèle 7B."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "样式作用于 AI 清理。每个应用都可以在下方对应的行中设置自己的样式。使用 Apple Intelligence 或 7B 模型时，Pro、个人以及你自定义的样式最能遵循指令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on AI cleanup": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer le nettoyage IA"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启 AI 清理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Untitled style": {
